Comment: 0,0:05:58.30,0:06:01.64,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Previsão do Tempo Para Amanhã
Comment: 0,0:12:00.95,0:12:02.16,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an8\3c&H8A8A8A&}Hoje
Comment: 0,0:12:00.95,0:12:02.16,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HB799FA&\pos(1004.001,396)}Receberam as mensagens? Espero que Mami esteja bem
Comment: 0,0:12:02.35,0:12:03.60,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an8\3c&HB799FA&}Estou preocupada
Comment: 0,0:12:03.60,0:12:04.94,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an8\3c&HB799FA&}Mami, está tudo bem? Entre em contato
Comment: 0,0:12:04.94,0:12:05.95,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an8\3c&HB799FA&}Mami, onde está? Sayaka me contou o que aconteceu
Comment: 0,0:12:05.95,0:12:07.79,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an8\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&H62B5C3&}Não importa o que aconteça, vou te salvar
Comment: 0,0:19:10.17,0:19:12.55,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an8\3c&H000000&\c&H2527BF&}Instalações de Isolamennto da Síndrome Doppel\N{\c&H19191C&\3c&H43C657&}Entrada Proibida
Comment: 0,0:22:01.97,0:22:05.30,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Você aceita isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:03:04.21,0:03:05.46,Signs,,0,0,0,,MIKAZUKI VILLA
Comment: 0,0:05:58.30,0:06:01.30,Signs,,0,0,0,,TOMORROW'S WEATHER
Comment: 0,0:12:00.95,0:12:03.41,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hoje
Comment: 0,0:12:00.95,0:12:02.24,Signs,,0,0,0,,Mami, are you getting my messages? \NI hope you're okay.
Comment: 0,0:12:02.16,0:12:04.66,Signs,,0,0,0,,Estou\Npreocupada.
Comment: 0,0:12:02.28,0:12:05.91,Signs,,0,0,0,,Mami, você está bem?\NPor favor, me ligue.
Comment: 0,0:12:03.49,0:12:05.96,Signs,,0,0,0,,Mami, onde você está?\NA Sayaka me contou o que aconteceu.
Comment: 0,0:12:04.87,0:12:05.96,Signs,,0,0,0,,Eu vou te salvar,\Nnão importa o que custe.
Comment: 0,0:12:05.96,0:12:07.46,Signs,,0,0,0,,Eu vou te salvar,\Nnão importa o que custe.
Comment: 0,0:12:27.23,0:12:31.98,Signs,,0,0,0,,Our success depends on you.\NStand tall\NBecome our Wings\NWe are {\u1}liberating Magical Girls{\u0} from their fate.\NTake the future into your own hands!
Comment: 2,0:12:27.23,0:12:31.98,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=0}{\blur0.8}We are \N{\u1}liberating Magical Girls{\u0} \Nfrom their fate. \NTake the future \Ninto your own hands!
Comment: 0,0:19:10.17,0:19:12.17,Signs,,0,0,0,,DOPPEL SICKNESS\NISOLATION WARD\NKEEP OUT
Comment: 0,0:22:01.97,0:22:04.97,Signs,,0,0,0,,Title: You’re Okay With All of This?!
Comment: 0,0:23:35.02,0:23:40.06,Signs,,0,0,0,,Endcard
Comment: 0,0:03:00.45,0:03:01.95,Signs,,0,0,0,,Magia Record
