Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.88,0:01:51.22,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Eu ainda sou apenas uma criança.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.22,0:01:52.80,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}É o que eu digo a mim mesma.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:54.72,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Mas eu sei que não é exatamente por isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.01,0:01:57.35,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Um dia, todas as desculpas que eu inventei
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.35,0:01:58.81,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}cairão sobre mim.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.22,0:02:01.60,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Eu ainda sou apenas uma criança,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.60,0:02:03.10,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}sentada no meu pequeno quarto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.10,0:02:05.19,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Enquanto peso meu pedaço de felicidade,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.40,0:02:10.86,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}o tempo passa, e logo esqueço o que o encheu de alegria.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.36,0:02:13.78,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Não há um roteiro com falas para ler.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.78,0:02:16.37,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Eu não sei como desempenhar meu papel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.91,0:02:21.70,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}De repente, tudo diante de mim desmoronou.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.75,0:02:24.17,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Eu sei que não estou ouvindo coisas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.29,0:02:26.29,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Não está só na minha cabeça.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.29,0:02:30.71,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Há uma voz que pode curar suavemente minhas feridas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.84,0:02:36.01,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFBAEFF&\blur3}Nós rimos juntas dos nossos erros combinados.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.05,0:02:41.68,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFBAEFF&\blur3}Mesmo que meus desejos escritos sejam desajeitados, é bom acreditar neles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.77,0:02:47.44,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFBAEFF&\blur3}Eu prometi a mim mesma que continuaria, não importa o quão longe ou por quanto tempo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.48,0:02:50.94,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFBAEFF&\blur3}Eu marcharei para o escuro e o desconhecido.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.78,0:02:55.99,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFBAEFF&\blur3}É assustador, mas eu sei que um dia...!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.94,0:22:24.82,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}te wo suberase shizunda uso wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.95,0:22:29.49,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}mada soko ni ukande kienai
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.91,0:22:33.71,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}miageta sora wa nigotte
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.79,0:22:39.55,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}nani ga honto itte
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.84,0:22:43.59,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}fukaku fukaku soko mukatte
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.18,0:22:49.76,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}negaigoto sagashi yume mogutta mama
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.85,0:22:57.73,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}makiagaru doro no naka wo nuke motto hayaku
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.57,0:23:02.19,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}atatakasa dake tamochi
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.19,0:23:04.53,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}sakasa no taiyou mezashi
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.78,0:23:09.28,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}nakushita kimi no ima ai ni yukou
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.49,0:23:12.33,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}hanashitara shizuka de
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.33,0:23:14.79,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}omoide ga sawagashii
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.87,0:23:19.71,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}imi no nai kotoba ga imi ni nareta
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.84,0:23:24.92,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}sekai no oku de oboreyou
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.94,0:22:24.82,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}As mentiras que deixei escapar afundaram,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.95,0:22:29.49,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}mas ainda flutuam lá no fundo, sem desaparecer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.91,0:22:33.71,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}Olho para o céu e vejo que está nublado,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.79,0:22:39.55,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}alguém pode me dizer o que é real?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.84,0:22:43.59,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}Mergulhando mais fundo na água,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.18,0:22:49.76,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}procurando meu pequeno desejo em um vasto mar de sonhos,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.85,0:22:57.73,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}correndo para cavar sob a lama interminável e emaranhada lá embaixo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.57,0:23:02.19,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}Segurando apenas o calor dentro de mim.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.19,0:23:04.53,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}Correndo em direção ao reflexo da luz do sol,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.78,0:23:09.28,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}e quando eu chegar lá, talvez eu encontre o tempo que você perdeu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.49,0:23:12.33,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}Quando eu respirar fundo e sentir a calma,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.33,0:23:14.79,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}e lembrar quando você ria comigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.87,0:23:19.71,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}O som das nossas conversas vazias ganha um novo significado,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.84,0:23:24.92,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}mas, lá no fundo, estamos nos afogando.
